👑🧠 Birbal and the Impossible Task (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar gave Birbal a strange task.

He said, “Bring me something that will make me happy when I am sad, and sad when I am happy.”

Birbal thought for a moment.

The next day, he gave Akbar a small ring.

On it were written the words: “This too shall pass.”

Akbar read the message.

Birbal explained, “When you are sad, this will remind you that your sadness will not last. When you are happy, it will remind you to stay humble.”

Akbar was very pleased.

💖 Moral:

Good and bad times do not last forever.
